Inspired by the above results, we simplify our residential dynamics equations to a toy model in order to gain a better mathematical understanding of the possible sociohydrodynamic behaviors. We consider two groups a = X, Y whose utility functions πa are linear in the fields φa (νabc = 0, see Fig. 5A,B). The flux in (3b) becomes
